---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="The Key Role of Class Delegates in Timetable Management"
  description="How empowering class delegates transforms classroom management and strengthens campus democracy."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrlFr="/fr/blog/2/"
  alternateUrlEn="/en/blog/2/"
>
  <article class="py-20 bg-slate-50 text-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
      <a href="/en/blog/" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 hover:underline mb-6 block">← Back to articles</a>
      <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block mb-2">September 28, 2026 • 3 min read</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">The Key Role of Class Delegates in Timetable Management</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-slate text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-slate-700">
        <p>Class delegates are essential bridges in academic life. By equipping them with digital reporting tools, administration gains speed and transparency.</p>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">Transparent Elections and Legitimacy</h2>
        <p>Pineapple OS includes a delegate election module with candidacy filing, manifestos, and secure voting. Legally elected delegates are trusted partners for academic offices.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
